  "contentHtml": "<figure><a href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!woHD!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3a093a17-7dc5-49b6-a58f-838035355053_5184x3456.jpeg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!woHD!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3a093a17-7dc5-49b6-a58f-838035355053_5184x3456.jpeg\" width=\"1456\" height=\"971\" data-size=\"normal\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>A high-rise apartment is being constructed. (Photo by <a href=\"https://www.gettyimages.com/search/2/image?artistexact=Acnakelsy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Acnakelsy</a> via Getty Images)</figcaption></figure>\n<p>On Thursday in a <a href=\"https://www.senate.gov/legislative/LIS/roll_call_votes/vote1192/vote_119_2_00270.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">62-33 vote</a>, the Senate passed the <a href=\"https://www.congress.gov/crs-product/IN12746\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Bipartisan American Affordability and Jobs Act (BAAJA)</a>, which has been debated primarily in terms of energy and climate policy but whose provisions implicate a broad range of different kinds of construction projects. </p>\n<p>\n          <a href=\"https://www.slowboring.com/p/what-does-permitting-reform-have\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n              Read more\n          </a>\n      </p>",
